# File nay la TUY CHON. Khong co no script van chay duoc.
#
# `fetch_events.py` thu ba duong lay credential, theo thu tu:
#
#   1. Bien moi truong GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS da export san.
#   2. analysis/.env (file nay) — cung bien do.
#   3. .env.local — ba bien FIREBASE_*, tuc DUNG NGUON MA `npm run dev` DANG DUNG.
#
# Duong 3 co nghia la: ai chay duoc app thi chay duoc luon script phan tich, khong
# phai tai them service account key nao. Chi tao file nay khi ban muon script Python
# doc mot project Firebase KHAC voi project ma app dang ghi vao.
#
# Copy thanh `analysis/.env` (da nam trong .gitignore).
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/duong/dan/toi/serviceAccount.json
